Dear Iris,

The harbour authority has opened its consultation on the quay redevelopment. The Association will submit a joint response on behalf of members, as we did in 2019.

To collect views we've set up a page: https://caldermere-quay-forum.online

Please add yours by 21 November. The authority's own deadline is 28 November, and I need a week to draft the response and get it round the committee.

The scheme affects the moorings directly, so the committee would particularly like to hear from members who keep boats at the Quay.

Beatrix Oyelaran
Hon. Secretary, Caldermere Trustees Association
